<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0 user-scalable=no">
    <title>User Account</title>
        <link rel="icon" href="assets/logo.png" type="image/png">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="style/output.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="scripts/index.js" defer></script>
    <script src="scripts/account.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="font-main">
    <div class="main-background">
        <div class="container mx-auto pt-5">
            {{> header}}

            <div class="account-form mt-[138px] mb-10 lg:h-[238px] w-full bg-white border border-stroke rounded-[20px] shadow-cards text-black-two">
                <form action="/account" method="post" class="card-content flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between mx-[50px] lg:ml-[120px] lg:mr-0">
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-center lg:block -mt-[50px] lg:mt-[35px] lg:mb-[30px]">
                        <img src="{{user.acc_avatar}}" alt="avatar" id="avatarImage" class="size-[119px] rounded-full object-cover mb-3 lg:mb-5">
                        <label id="avatarButton" for="file-upload" class="relative flex justify-center items-center bg-main-yellow w-[120px] h-[35px] rounded-[25px]
                            hover:bg-main-yellow-hover duration-300">
                            <span class="absolute text-base text-white font-black">Изменить</span>
                            <input id="imageInput" type="file" name="file-upload" accept="image/png, image/jpeg" class="opacity-0"> 
                        </label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between mt-[35px] mb-[30px]">
                        <p class="text-3xl text-center lg:text-left lg:text-[40px] lg:h-[49px] lg:mt-3 font-black">{{user.acc_name}}</p>
                        <p class="mt-3 lg:mt-0 text-lg lg:text-xl">{{user.acc_email}}</p>
                        <div id="logCont" class="opacity-0 cursor-default flex lg:block w-full lg:w-auto">
                            <span>логин:</span>
                            <input id="logField" type="password" placeholder="" class="text-2xl ml-1 outline-none cursor-default w-full lg:w-auto" readonly>
                        </div>
                        <div id="passCont" class="opacity-0 cursor-default flex lg:block w-full lg:w-auto">
                            <span>Пароль:</span>
                            <input id="passField" type="password" placeholder="" class="text-2xl ml-1 outline-none cursor-default w-full lg:w-auto" readonly>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between items-end w-full lg:w-[344.2px] mt-[35px] mb-[30px]">
                        <button id="editAccount" class="mr-[46px] mt-4 mb-4"><img src="assets/account/edit.png" alt=""></button>
                        <div class="buttons flex justify-between w-full hidden">
                            <button id="confirm" type="submit" class="bg-main-yellow w-[120px] lg:w-[161px] h-[37px] rounded-[25px] text-white text-xl font-semibold hover:bg-main-yellow-hover duration-300">принять</button>
                            <button id="cancel" class="bg-main-yellow w-[120px] lg:w-[161px] h-[37px] rounded-[25px] text-white text-xl font-semibold hover:bg-main-yellow-hover duration-300 lg:ml-[18px]">отменить</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden lg:flex justify-center flex-col items-center h-[238px] w-[540px] text-white bg-main-yellow border border-white rounded-[20px]">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-3xl mb-[18px]">Ваша скидка: <span>10%</span></p>
                            <p class="text-xl mb-[38px]">Сумма заказов: <span>5675</span> ₽*</p>
                            <p class="text-[16px] text-black">*До скидки <span>15%</span> не хватает покупок на сумму: <span>1255</span> ₽</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
            <div class="orders text-xl h-auto w-full mb-[50px] bg-white border border-stroke rounded-[20px] shadow-cards text-black-two">
                <div class="orders-content flex flex-col mt-4 lg:mt-[60px] mb-[73px] lg:mx-[120px]">
                    <p class="font-normal text-center lg:text-left text-3xl mb-4 lg:mb-[82px]">Мои заказы</p>
                    <div class="w-full lg:w-auto border border-black rounded-[20px] lg:border-none px-[15px] py-[30px] lg:px-0 lg:py-0">
                        <p class="text-left lg:text-right font mb-[31px] lg:mb-[50px]">Дата доставки: <span>03.08.2021</span></p>
                        <div class="w-[341px] lg:w-[1249px] mx-auto lg:mb-[49px] bg-gray-stroke-two lg:bg-transparent rounded-[5px]">
                            <table class="text-left lg:w-full text-sm lg:text-xl lg:table">
                                <thead class="text-black-two">
                                    <tr class="">
                                        <th class="font-normal pb-[18px] w-[170px] lg:w-auto">Товаров:</th>
                                        <th class="font-normal pb-[18px]">Сумма заказа:</th>
                                        <th class="font-normal pb-[18px]">Скидка (<span>10%</span>):</th>
                                        <th class="font-normal pb-[18px]">Сумма заказа:</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody class="text-grayText">
                                    {{#each korzina}}
                                    <tr idclass="">
                                        <td id="nameBookAll" class="pt-[10px]  w-[170px] lg:w-auto"><span id="countBook">{{this.count}}</span>x{{this.book_name}}</td>
                                        <td id="startPriceAll" class="pt-[10px]"><span id="startPrice">{{this.book_price}}</span> ₽</td>
                                        <td id="discountAll" class="pt-[10px]"><span id="discount"></span> ₽ </td>
                                        <td id="finalPriceAll" class="pt-[10px]"><span id="finalPrice"></span> ₽ </td>
                                    </tr>
                                    {{/each}}
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between lg:flex-row items-center lg:text-right">
                            <button class="bg-main-yellow mt-3 lg:mt-0 mb-3 lg:mb-0 w-[341px] lg:w-[520px] h-[50px] lg:h-[70px] rounded-[25px] text-white text-[25px] font-black hover:bg-main-yellow-hover duration-300">книга пришла</button>
                            <div class="flex flex-row justify-between w-full lg:flex-col text-base text-grayText lg:text-lg">
                                <p>Сумма заказа: <span id="totalPrice"></span>₽</p>
                                <p>Доставка: <span>350 ₽</span></p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="orders text-xl h-auto w-full mb-[50px] bg-white border border-stroke rounded-[20px] shadow-cards text-black-two">
                <div class="orders-content flex flex-col mt-4 lg:mt-[60px] mb-[73px] lg:mx-[120px]">
                    <p class="font-normal text-center lg:text-left text-3xl mb-4 lg:mb-[82px]">Мои заказы</p>
                    <div class="w-full lg:w-auto border border-black rounded-[20px] lg:border-none px-[15px] py-[30px] lg:px-0 lg:py-0">
                        <p class="text-left lg:text-right font mb-[31px] lg:mb-[50px]">Дата доставки: <span>03.08.2021</span></p>
                        <div class="w-[341px] lg:w-[1249px] mx-auto lg:mb-[49px] bg-gray-stroke-two lg:bg-transparent rounded-[5px]">
                            <table class="text-left lg:w-full text-sm lg:text-xl lg:table">
                                <thead class="text-black-two">
                                    <tr class="">
                                        <th class="font-normal pb-[18px] w-[170px] lg:w-auto">Товаров:</th>
                                        <th class="font-normal pb-[18px]">Сумма заказа:</th>
                                        <th class="font-normal pb-[18px]">Скидка (<span>10%</span>):</th>
                                        <th class="font-normal pb-[18px]">Сумма заказа:</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody class="text-grayText">
                                    {{#each korzina}}
                                    <tr idclass="">
                                        <td id="nameBookAll" class="pt-[10px]  w-[170px] lg:w-auto"><span id="countBook">{{this.count}}</span>x{{this.book_name}}</td>
                                        <td id="startPriceAll" class="pt-[10px]"><span id="startPrice">{{this.book_price}}</span> ₽</td>
                                        <td id="discountAll" class="pt-[10px]"><span id="discount"></span> ₽ </td>
                                        <td id="finalPriceAll" class="pt-[10px]"><span id="finalPrice"></span> ₽ </td>
                                    </tr>
                                    {{/each}}
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between lg:flex-row items-center lg:text-right">
                            <button class="bg-button-confirm mt-3 lg:mt-0 mb-3 lg:mb-0 w-[341px] lg:w-[520px] h-[50px] lg:h-[70px] rounded-[25px] text-white text-[25px] font-black">Принято</button>
                            <div class="flex flex-row justify-between w-full lg:flex-col text-base text-grayText lg:text-lg">
                                <p>Сумма заказа: <span id="totalPrice"></span>₽</p>
                                <p>Доставка: <span>350 ₽</span></p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-auto text-xl h-auto w-full mb-[50px] bg-white border border-stroke lg:border-none lg:bg-transparent rounded-[20px]">
                <h2 class="text-center lg:text-left mt-[55px] lg:mt-0 text-3xl text-black lg:text-white mb-[40px]">Персональные акции</h2>
                <div class="sales flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:mb-[113px] lg:gap-5">
                    <div class="sale-card h-[332px] lg:h-[449px] mb-[62px] lg:mb-0 bg-[url('/assets/account/sale1.jfif')] object-fill rounded-[20px] brightness-[0.8]">
                        <p class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-normal text-white mt-[136px] lg:mt-[216px]">Купи 3 книги<br> и получи 4-ую в подарок!</p>
                        <p class="text-xl font-normal text-white mt-[55px] lg:mt-[95px] ml-5">Срок акции: до <span>31.08.2021</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sale-card h-[332px] lg:h-[449px] mb-[62px] lg:mb-0 bg-[url('/assets/account/sale2.jfif')] object-fill rounded-[20px] brightness-[0.8]">
                        <p class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-normal text-white mt-[136px] lg:mt-[216px]">Купи 3 книги<br> и получи 4-ую в подарок!</p>
                        <p class="text-xl font-normal text-white mt-[55px] lg:mt-[95px] ml-5">Срок акции: до <span>31.08.2021</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sale-card h-[332px] lg:h-[449px] mb-[62px] lg:mb-0 bg-[url('/assets/account/sale3.jfif')] object-fill rounded-[20px] brightness-[0.8]">
                        <p class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-normal text-white mt-[136px] lg:mt-[216px]">Купи 3 книги<br> и получи 4-ую в подарок!</p>
                        <p class="text-xl font-normal text-white mt-[55px] lg:mt-[95px] ml-5">Срок акции: до <span>31.08.2021</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sale-card h-[332px] lg:h-[449px] mb-[62px] lg:mb-0 bg-[url('/assets/account/sale4.jfif')] object-fill rounded-[20px] brightness-[0.8]">
                        <p class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-normal text-white mt-[136px] lg:mt-[216px]">Купи 3 книги<br> и получи 4-ую в подарок!</p>
                        <p class="text-xl font-normal text-white mt-[55px] lg:mt-[95px] ml-5">Срок акции: до <span>31.08.2021</span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="newsletter flex flex-col lg:block text-white">
                <p class="mx-auto lg:mx-0 mt-[126px] lg:mt-0 mb-[50px] font-black text-3xl w-[220px] lg:w-auto lg:text-[50px]">Подписка на новости и рассылку</p>
                <p class="mx-auto lg:mx-0 mb-[28px] text-xl lg:text-[25px] w-[220px] lg:w-[757px]">Подпишитесь на нашу рассылку прямо сейчас и будьте в курсе новых
                    поставок, скидок и эксклюзивных предложений.</p>
                <form class="flex flex-col lg:block relative mb-5 mx-auto lg:mx-0 w-[335px] lg:h-auto lg:w-[1100px] h-auto text-[25px]">
                    <input class="mb-[200px] lg:mb-0 border-none bg-[#F3F3F3] h-20 rounded-[40px] size-full outline-none font-normal text-black-two pl-[60px] placeholder:text-[#C9C9C9]" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Ваш email">
                    <button class="absolute top-[150px] lg:top-0 w-full lg:right-0 lg:w-[260px] h-20 bg-main-yellow hover:bg-main-yellow-hover rounded-[40px] font-bold" type="submit">Подписаться</button>
                </form>
                <p class="hidden lg:block mb-[146px] text-base font-normal">Нажимая на кнопку “Подписаться", вы принимаете правила 
                    <a class="text-main-yellow" href="">пользовательского соглашения</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        {{> secondFooter}}
    </div>

</body>
</html>